<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>蕭吉甫的研究筆記 | Chifu's Research Blog</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500&family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #F7F7F5;
            --text-main: #2C2C2C;
            --text-muted: #888888;
            --accent-color: #A68A64;
            --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
            --border-radius: 12px;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.7;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, .serif { font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif; }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 80px 24px;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 80px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: #111;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        header p.bio {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .post-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(400px, 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .post-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
            transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.4s ease;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            height: 100%;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
        }

        .post-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }

        .post-image {
            width: 100%;
            padding-top: 56.25%;
            position: relative;
            background-color: #F0F0F0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .post-image img, .post-image .bg-img {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.6s ease;
        }

        .post-card:hover .post-image .bg-img {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .post-image.empty-state {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F5F3EB 0%, #E8E5DA 100%);
        }
        .post-image.empty-state::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background-image: radial-gradient(var(--accent-color) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 20px 20px;
            opacity: 0.15;
        }

        .post-content {
            padding: 32px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .post-meta {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        .post-title {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .post-title a {
            color: var(--text-main);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .post-title a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        .post-excerpt {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            display: -webkit-box;
            -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
            -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
            overflow: hidden;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .post-footer {
            margin-top: auto;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .read-more {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-weight: 500;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .read-more svg {
            width: 16px; height: 16px;
            margin-left: 6px;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .read-more:hover { color: var(--accent-color); }
        .read-more:hover svg { transform: translateX(4px); }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .post-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            header h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>蕭吉甫的研究筆記</h1>
            <p class="bio">建築、數位構築、空間哲學與 XR 探索<br>Chifu's Research Blog</p>
        </header>
        
        <main class="post-grid">
            </main>
    </div>

</body>
</html>